Description: An unofficial R client for the 'SeaTable' REST API. Provides
    authentication with transparent base-token refresh, tidy 'tibble'
    returns for tables, rows, columns and views, helpers for managing
    bases and files, and an optional 'shiny' explorer for interactive
    inspection. The 'SeaTable' REST API is documented at
    <https://api.seatable.com/>. 'SeaTable' is a trademark of SeaTable
    GmbH; this package is not affiliated with or endorsed by SeaTable
    GmbH.
